  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.2.1 - WhisperModelSize.Large now maps to GgmlType.LargeV2 instead of LargeV3 to avoid long-form repetition-loop hallucinations in large-v3. Cache filename changes to ggml-large-v2.bin; the previous ggml-large-v3.bin (~3 GB) becomes orphaned and can be deleted manually from {UserProfile}/.fieldcure/whisper-models/. Korean clean-clip CER regresses ~1.1 % vs v3 (mostly spacing / numeric-notation conventions); long-form WER drops from 100 %+ to ~2.5 %. See tools/AudioBenchmark/baseline-2026-04-27.md for the measurements behind this decision.",
